  "project_description": "A low-level PHP client library for the ActiveCampaign v3 marketing/CRM REST API, packaged as a Drupal module. It stores per-account credentials (base URL + API token) in a config entity and exposes typed endpoint and resource classes for contacts, lists, tags, fields and account-contact data, plus an event-tracking service. It is primarily a dependency of higher-level integrations such as contact_activecampaign and provides no end-user UI beyond an admin account manager and diagnostic test forms.",
